        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-09T14:01:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am concerned about the scalability and maintainability of listing every possible test and device combination here as a rule in addition to having to specify it where ever we have our list of jobs that should run on the CI.\n\nWhat benefits are there to listing them all instead of listing a more general \"ganesh_tests\" target that the developer can augment with something like --config\u003dpixel5 and --config\u003dgl ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 328,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 328,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "7cbd06060ea686e6322c393259e810b99dea7a8e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3a185d96_1f646807",
        "filename": "tests/BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 328,
      "author": {
        "id": 10009
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T01:20:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removed the comprehensive list of tests as per our chat, along with the flavors and devices mechanisms. Tests can now be specialized using `--config\u003dpixel_5`, `--config\u003dgl_ganesh`, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "08802526_75fd6fb9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 328,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 328,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "7cbd06060ea686e6322c393259e810b99dea7a8e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
